```mdl
verdict ProfileOf: The relation has the declared fields but a different typename, and lives in @dxos/types.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/types/src/types/ProfileOf.ts#ProfileOf]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-crm/src/operations/research.test.ts]
  note: 'Typename is `org.dxos.relation.plugin-crm.profileOf`, not `...profile-of`. Source and target are `Obj.Unknown`, so the Document to Person|Organization constraint is not enforced by the schema.'
```

